.\" zcat.1 -- maux's stub for the POSIX zcat(1) utility, which this
.\" tree does not provide. An original page (this project's own
.\" text), so it carries no third-party notice -- MIT like the code,
.\" same posture as env.1/man.1. Recorded in docs/POSIX-GAPS.md sec
.\" 5 ("Not applicable, and why") so the omission is not re-
.\" litigated. Rendered at build time to build/man/ZCAT.TXT and
.\" staged on the play image as /usr/man/ZCAT.
.TH ZCAT 1 "September 17, 2026" maux
.SH NAME
zcat \- expand and concatenate data
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Zcat
is not provided on maux.
LZW compression is possible on a 1 MHz 6502 (ShrinkIt did it)
but nothing on this machine needs it yet.
